WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.509 --> 00:00:03.379
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.379 --> 00:00:05.349
- [Jake] Ooh.

00:00:05.349 --> 00:00:07.019
When I first started treasure hunting

00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:09.131
I would come down to the river
pretty much every single day

00:00:09.131 --> 00:00:12.948
and surf and raft and have
a good time at the river.

00:00:12.948 --> 00:00:14.691
But the first time I
went underneath the water

00:00:14.691 --> 00:00:18.858
it just opened my eyes to a
world I didn't know existed.

00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:21.302
My name is Jake Koehler.

00:00:21.302 --> 00:00:22.930
I'm a free diver and treasure hunter.

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:23.797
You guys ready?

00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:24.638
- Let's do it.
- I'm ready man.

00:00:24.638 --> 00:00:26.399
- Let's do it man.

00:00:26.399 --> 00:00:28.740
I dive in the Chattahoochee
River in Columbus, Georgia

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.067
which is one of the world's largest

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:31.988
urban whitewater courses ever built.

00:00:31.988 --> 00:00:33.239
So this is actually Georgia

00:00:33.239 --> 00:00:35.967
and the other side of
the river is Alabama.

00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:38.228
Thousands of people go down
this river every single year

00:00:38.228 --> 00:00:39.519
and they lose all kinds of valuables

00:00:39.519 --> 00:00:41.239
and it's a lot of fun
to go out there and swim

00:00:41.239 --> 00:00:44.239
and see if I can find
some stuff they've lost.

00:00:44.239 --> 00:00:47.607
(mellow jazz music)

00:00:47.607 --> 00:00:48.858
Some of the most interesting
things I've found

00:00:48.858 --> 00:00:52.948
definitely have to be like
iPhones, GoPros, pistols.

00:00:52.948 --> 00:00:54.039
(water bubbling)

00:00:54.039 --> 00:00:56.207
(laughing)

00:00:56.207 --> 00:00:57.040
Always pretty interesting

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.325
to find a potential murder
weapon out here in the river,

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:02.538
but GoPros and phones,
definitely my favorite finds.

00:01:02.538 --> 00:01:03.855
When I find these cameras and phones

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:06.038
I try to just figure out who it belongs to

00:01:06.038 --> 00:01:08.445
because not only like finding
this stuff is a lot of fun,

00:01:08.445 --> 00:01:10.847
but giving back the
devices that they've lost

00:01:10.847 --> 00:01:12.068
is also a blast.

00:01:12.068 --> 00:01:12.908
Here you go buddy.

00:01:12.908 --> 00:01:13.839
- [Police Officer] Be careful out here.

00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:14.818
- I will.

00:01:14.818 --> 00:01:16.479
Not only you find a lot of cool stuff

00:01:16.479 --> 00:01:17.938
that people lose after rafting,

00:01:17.938 --> 00:01:20.418
but thousands upon thousands
of fishermen come up here

00:01:20.418 --> 00:01:22.776
and normally no one would go out there

00:01:22.776 --> 00:01:24.078
and collect all these fishing lures,

00:01:24.078 --> 00:01:26.388
but I go out there and I'll
free them from the wall,

00:01:26.388 --> 00:01:27.327
free them from the stumps

00:01:27.327 --> 00:01:29.258
and it just kind of cleans up the area

00:01:29.258 --> 00:01:31.675
and I get free fishing lures.

00:01:32.738 --> 00:01:33.738
There's a lot of animals
underneath the water.

00:01:33.738 --> 00:01:36.476
You've got a lot of striped
bass, shad, spotted bass

00:01:36.476 --> 00:01:38.239
and catfish.

00:01:38.239 --> 00:01:40.706
You see a lot of turtles down here too.

00:01:40.706 --> 00:01:43.156
It's just super beautiful
to see all that stuff.

00:01:43.156 --> 00:01:45.236
- [Diver] Okay first day
back and Jake finds a GoPro.

00:01:45.236 --> 00:01:48.417
He was diving right next to me.

00:01:48.417 --> 00:01:49.988
- I was really surprised how
many people were interested

00:01:49.988 --> 00:01:51.904
in watching treasure hunting videos.

00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:52.737
Someone said hey?

00:01:52.737 --> 00:01:56.024
Hey, we've got another fan over there.

00:01:56.024 --> 00:01:58.174
I love coming down here, look for treasure

00:01:58.174 --> 00:01:59.534
and surfing and have a good time

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:01.712
but I didn't know I could
actually do this as like

00:02:01.712 --> 00:02:02.894
a full time job.

00:02:02.894 --> 00:02:05.363
I started my YouTube channel
and recorded myself swimming

00:02:05.363 --> 00:02:06.864
and having a good time at the river

00:02:06.864 --> 00:02:09.054
and one thing led to another
and now I'm able to do this

00:02:09.054 --> 00:02:10.509
as my full time job.

00:02:10.509 --> 00:02:11.425
- [Man] Oh my god.

00:02:11.425 --> 00:02:12.908
Twenty more, twenty more.

00:02:12.908 --> 00:02:15.011
Oh it's going quick bro.

00:02:15.011 --> 00:02:15.844
Two more.

00:02:16.915 --> 00:02:19.832
(friends cheering)

00:02:21.392 --> 00:02:22.624
You did it man.

00:02:22.624 --> 00:02:24.364
- The more I travel the more
I realize that this spot

00:02:24.364 --> 00:02:25.813
is actually one of a kind.

00:02:25.813 --> 00:02:27.424
There's not many places in the
world that you can actually

00:02:27.424 --> 00:02:32.007
surf at a river, you could
fish and treasure hunt.

00:02:32.007 --> 00:02:34.069
I have a love for this river, man.

00:02:34.069 --> 00:02:35.017
I just can't stay inside.

00:02:35.017 --> 00:02:36.537
I have to go down and have a good time.

00:02:36.537 --> 00:02:37.977
(laughing)

00:02:37.977 --> 00:02:40.560
(upbeat music)

